<!--
Delta Pulse 台達脈動：期數列表首頁（POC 網頁版）。
沿用 pulse.html.jinja 的「藍圖紙」視覺語言，保持同一套設計系統。
-->
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>{{ newsletter_name }}</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #eef1f4; --panel-solid: #ffffff; --panel-border: #dde3e8;
    --accent: #2a5db0; --accent-dim: #6f93cf;
    --text-primary: #1c2b38; --text-secondary: #57707f; --text-tertiary: #8298a6;
    --rule: #e2e8ec;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body {
    margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: var(--bg);
    background-image: linear-gradient(var(--rule) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, var(--rule) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 28px 28px; background-attachment: fixed;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "PingFang TC", "Noto Sans TC", "Microsoft JhengHei", sans-serif;
  }
  .mono { font-family: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", "Cascadia Mono", "Roboto Mono", monospace; }
  a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  .masthead { padding: 28px clamp(16px, 4vw, 48px) 22px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--panel-border); background: var(--panel-solid); }
  .masthead-eyebrow { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--accent); text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 0 6px; }
  .masthead h1 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 30px); font-weight: 700; }
  .masthead p { margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--text-secondary); }
  .issue-list { padding: 24px clamp(16px, 4vw, 48px) 40px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
  .issue-card {
    display: block; background: var(--panel-solid); border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
    border-radius: 4px; padding: 16px 20px;
  }
  .issue-card:hover { border-color: var(--accent-dim); }
  .issue-card-meta { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-tertiary); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .issue-card-hook { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; }
  .empty { padding: 24px clamp(16px, 4vw, 48px); color: var(--text-tertiary); font-size: 13px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="masthead">
  <p class="masthead-eyebrow mono">Delta Pulse 台達脈動</p>
  <h1>{{ newsletter_name }}</h1>
  <p>POC 階段：本機網頁檢視，資料來源為長期文章池（SQLite）。</p>
</header>

{% if issues %}
<div class="issue-list">
  {% for issue in issues %}
  <a class="issue-card" href="/issues/{{ issue.id }}">
    <div class="issue-card-meta mono">第 {{ issue.id }} 期 · {{ issue.issue_date }}</div>
    <div class="issue-card-hook">{{ issue.hook or '（尚無導言）' }}</div>
  </a>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
{% else %}
<p class="empty">目前還沒有任何一期。跑 <code>python -m scripts.compose_issue</code> 組一期看看。</p>
{% endif %}

</body>
</html>
